WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:03.178
The security policy was right in the repo,

2
00:00:03.178 --> 00:00:05.119
and missing on the live site.

3
00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:11.169
A correct Content Security Policy did not protect the live pages.

4
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:16.448
I checked the headers on every response type, not just the home page.

5
00:00:16.448 --> 00:00:18.163
Scripts and fonts had none.

6
00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:23.756
Headers generated at build time and included in every server block,

7
00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:28.235
inline scripts removed, and a proxy that bypassed it all closed.

8
00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:34.149
All eight headers on every response, and the security retest passed.

